@startuml
title D-01 Continuity Context Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Parker" as Parker
actor "Operator / Cashier" as Operator
actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor
actor "Operations / Reconciliation" as Recon

component "ExitPass Continuity\ncontrolled degraded operations" as Continuity
component "Central PMS\ncontrol state + finality + ExitAuthorization" as Central
component "Vendor PMS / HCP\nnormal session + tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Session Projection\noperational visibility" as Projection
component "Continuity Terminal\nAssisted Payment Terminal mode" as Terminal
component "Operator Console\nnon-payment governance" as Console
component "Payment Orchestrator /\napproved payment integration" as Pay
component "Resolved Site POS Server\nfiscal issuance" as POS
component "Gate / Exit System\nCentral PMS authorization consumer" as Gate
component "Dashboard / Reporting" as Dashboard

Parker --> Terminal : assisted / continuity service
Operator --> Terminal : controlled workflow
Supervisor --> Console : activation / review
Recon --> Dashboard : review and reconcile

Continuity --> Central : degraded resolve policy
Central --> Vendor : normal live resolve when available
Central --> Projection : freshness / fallback check
Terminal --> Central : continuity requests
Central --> Pay : payment flow where allowed
Central --> POS : fiscal issuance where available and allowed
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization
Console --> Continuity : approval / incident context
Continuity --> Dashboard : activation, exceptions,\nreconciliation backlog

note right of Projection
Operational visibility only.
Not financial truth.
Not tariff authority.
Not exit authority.
end note

@enduml
